  "releaseNotes": "- Fixed critical SVAML action construction bug where suppressCallbacks was being set twice with incorrect values\n- ConnectAgent now correctly sets suppressCallbacks as boolean true and maxDuration as number 3600\n\n- Refactored ConnectAgent methods to eliminate code duplication between IceSvamletBuilder and PieSvamletBuilder\n- Extracted common logic to AgentSipHelper.BuildConnectAgentAction() for maintainability\n\nThe bug caused SVAML responses to have suppressCallbacks:3600 instead of the correct:\n- suppressCallbacks: true\n- maxDuration: 3600\n\nThis has been fixed by consolidating the action construction logic into a shared helper method.",
